Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:19:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] [cloud_stream] Add RemoteInput to feed gateway input into
 aura hosts

Convert kMouse/kWheel/kKey/kText/kComposition messages into ui::Events and
send them to the target WindowTreeHost through SendEventToSink(), like
DesktopWindowTreeHostWin does for native messages. Text and IME results go
through the host's TextInputClient because a synthesized key down never
yields WM_CHAR.

Mouse button bits are not equal to ui::EventFlags, so map them explicitly
and fix the protocol header comment.

